ng to this world through greed and malice, and his eyes betray a strength of mind beyond any puny mortal.  All nearby are utterly subservient to his will, though he stands aloof from them, as if to say he needs not the pathetic meddling of minions to help him overcome his foes.  Your eyes are drawn to a dark staff in his hands which seems to suck the very life from the air around it.  It looks ancient and dangerous and terrible, and the sight of it fills you with fervent desire.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个拥有强大力量的可怕吸血鬼，他的长袍无风自动，周身环绕着恐惧光环。他冰冷而强壮的肉体似乎在向世界宣告着贪婪和怨恨，他的眼神透露着一股睥睨天下的自信。周围的不死族都完全服从于他，尽管如此，他还是表现出厌恶的神情，就好像他不需要这些废物来御敌一样。你的目光被他手里的黑色法杖所吸引，这根法杖似乎在不断的吸取周围的活力。它看起来古老而可怕，看到它的瞬间，你心底的欲望被彻底点燃了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ed7cde50e426b1f49da246cb26af0a76bec09a9612dcc9f84d6e10634eaba999","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"965eaca9cf053d3d7c0dd3f289f0a8eb79f87af9c15595c1ca7863a7bfc520a4","logical_entry_identity":"24da6032af9cea46f39075023610983d1d96cc6d3d9718bd8cba1c5020dda94d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Intimidated","source_tag":"_t","target":"胆怯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4387971df67b3def72ebc8b0e566d8b0ed2b2a6cf737aff188e724fe5f871148","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9660569d527562e1a465bfad679fc936ca6deba21ed459d8801e177b82eccea5","logical_entry_identity":"d9aac27550cc1177c5354b070ae89065f4da86ceb83fd43d1f545fe8929c7dc2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#%s reaches critical velocity!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#%s 达到了临界速度！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"efcbcff2d40fd773cd0ced8dd2a41de51d90ccbefc2bd3076f9bc1894a3b5276","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"966b605b3ccfc2e66badc0c37709680421d770aac11f638d0c4fef28e8e5cecb","logical_entry_identity":"7637d078be9ba70df13a66088e7f71cec4cf2a3b9c1308ef34813eedf170a549","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Increases your damage and resistance penetration on sleeping targets by %d%%.  Additionally, every time you slay a sleeping target, a Night Terror will be summoned for %d turns.\n\t\tThe Night Terror's stats will scale with your Mindpower, as will the damage bonus to sleeping targets.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"增加 %d%% 你对睡眠状态目标的伤害和抗性穿透效果。另外每当你杀死一个睡眠状态的目标，你可以召唤一只持续 %d 回合的暗夜恐魔。\n\t\t受精神强度影响，伤害和暗夜恐魔的属性按比例加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c3398f0da8cfc1d3fab9c95b430594b7519edb8200e0faa8442addc1d548d9fe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9674d51d521c74d45a579fa1c77807be61f4322a9eee2bb32caa3122e7bb78f6","logical_entry_identity":"43e90775a46898cd9ccba7e542aad990d2b5bda704e764e3ba399802ee3a4221","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Writ Large","source_tag":"_t","target":"-符文亲和"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a2a375f40499382f66620a94fea0b00c4c448add07826320e1e5f3e7e00fd750","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"967872ba7946abcf43e3819a8edad2af5cfd4b71dedd5e37d13692bf6a2c253d","logical_entry_identity":"a693914536884da02fc315a5cd3ce81c83f5a24ef8e033d89e41b393847cf3be","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Allows a mage to teleport to the secret town of Angolwen.\n\tYou have studied the magic arts there and have been granted a special portal spell to teleport there.\n\tNobody must learn about this spell and so it should never be used while seen by any creatures.\n\tThe spell will take time to activate. You must be out of sight of any creature when you cast it and when the teleportation takes effect.","source_tag":"_t","target":"允许你传送至秘密的小镇：安格利文。\n\t你曾在那里研习魔法，并获授一道特殊的传送门法术，可传送回去。\n\t不能让任何人知道此法术，因此绝不能在任何生物能看见你的情况下使用。\n\t法术需要一段时间才能生效。施法时以及传送生效时，你都必须处于任何生物的视线之外。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"66e5dff5802e2426802d29faa77d17feb66d214327367e3630dd0f373134ccc8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9679988d2198fa8711b8ee492b69021d72109d83c75aef5e696d06a41127756e","logical_entry_identity":"2801411b47e6146d466acaea6e1a6a7ceae0275ebd2d311c4ec6d4634670d811","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A wave of energy passes through your fungus, making it release immediate healing energies on you, healing you for %d%% of your current life regeneration rate (#GREEN#%d#LAST#).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"一股强大的能量穿过你的孢子，使其立刻对你释放治愈性能量，治疗你 %d%% 当前生命回复值（#GREEN# %d #LAST#）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dfb8ed549ded1894bad587aa1f98df9aad9e687615c29328e4acfaf1aa4c5060","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"967ab96aa7f9c06ab20e7d1f604089a2a2275e8c9e31d2cc22682f480d8a972c","logical_entry_identity":"e30bca664ec8ae53fc95c71cc7a1f64fae6de0d19422a5fbdf16c696f8276ef6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Oh, let's try something else then.","source_tag":"_t","target":"好吧，我们试试别的东西。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8bdbfb66b10bf95a476c9138ec1f3bfcfc004bae4e182c4911eeb127ef792840","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"967c51f2915e7277960a165522b8f3488973e76dfd5d43d45433557276ccf2ff","logical_entry_identity":"c596fb917cbfe0de073b6ca30d6b13d9bd0d70df380f5a2f338a25bbc6e28a38","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"fortress","source_tag":"talent type","target":"堡垒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7013af1eb2cf51f14edf90eb91b9950f671e17dd4c6b896cbc31bdfe77a148e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9683d4b1ec930964aac63cfb03fc261646fb2b75b19240154b92f23b9478c965","logical_entry_identity":"40a8832a9924b4a95667c2c5bc893bc6265356d8191e2b73921d82c7a2e65419","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"'What is Magic' by Archmage Tarelion","source_tag":"entity name","target":"大法师泰尔兰关于“什么是魔法”的演讲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4bcb3f85917adc584fe4fa05f124ec38e21cb2be86cd578fc7a95bb259578d55","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"968479f012fb2dd92ed02f80c9b42ddc9f25b6bcd25d7e82d3aff737ba9046aa","logical_entry_identity":"ca35e257afe6d6442fae0e41d1ba9dd346f01cd530e2ce6fd83001b3a25e0b78","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Oh, what terrible horrors! Demons, clawed creatures, dark smog, clouds of acid, skins of lava! Where did they all come from?!\n\nIt was when I was studying the moonstone, and as the red star was rising again before the dawn. The stone glowed blood-red and suddenly portals awakened in the rock of the valley. From them poured forth all manner of demonic creatures! I put my ring of invisibility on and fled into the caves. But now the creatures are everywhere! The caves are infested with them, prowling about like hungry animals.\n\nAnd there is something... something terrible. In the shadows, in the darkness, I can sense it looking for me. It stalks me, an invisible hunter after invisible prey. Now and then I hear the cracking of a terrible whip. I must stay hidden...","source_tag":"_t","target":"啊，真是可怕极了！一群恶魔，长着利爪的生物，黑暗的烟雾，酸性的毒云，熔岩覆盖的肌肤！这群家伙到底是从哪里来的？！\n\n那时我正在潜行研究着月亮石，那颗红色的星星正在黎明前的夜空升起。突然间，月亮石变得血红，从峡谷的岩石中冒出了一大堆奇怪的传送门。从传送门中跑出来了各种各样的恶魔！我连忙卷起铺盖启动隐形戒指跑进山洞，但是连山洞里也到处都是那群生物！看来，整个山洞都被他们所占领，他们饥渴地四处游荡捕猎着。\n\n而且，在他们中有一个……一个可怕的存在。在迷蒙的黑暗和阴影中，我可以感受到他正在追寻着我，一个隐形的猎人正在追踪着同样隐形的我——作为猎物。我现在甚至能听到恐怖的鞭打声，我必须赶紧藏起来……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ffa6bd3bd55b357ef599c2d727fc1daa64bf74a81e8f9e67e65e214dd881cbdb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"968c0950ab70882365e2fa3846208be98e0c36d9d557df837349b22c7f1d2711","logical_entry_identity":"669a45afb13543b4162a47c6f31e7cdeadc60fb9727d9f942384e6854e0aa5a2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#SLATE#* The fortress shadow has asked that you come back as soon as possible.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#SLATE#* 堡垒之影希望你尽快回来。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e8e4892e4e98297570af8d15b8378e161df0a545e17631c25e55e34428f7e6ec","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"968ff050dcf3163748bf4ac1408450bf7392a90929841963b52c6ad45046b346","logical_entry_identity":"0acde7d584a5fb4b92c8dba008b626b7da93e58c5260b374b48de7d83f9d38dd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"@Source@ creates a bubble of nul time.","source_tag":"_t","target":"@Source@制造出停滞时间气泡。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3db872083f5644a287d7cd7e09f2807ae2dad3630c6e4c232f1fdf77